{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-168",
  "title": "Proposed Agenda",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Proposed Agenda"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🔹 **Creative Strategy Session: Trica Keaton Website Design**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Duration:** 60–75 minutes"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Participants:** Design team, Darius, Professor Keaton (if present)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Facilitator:** You"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**0. Arrival & Grounding (5 min)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "brief hello, intention-setting"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "a word about tone: this space is about clarity, care, and quiet power"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1. Core Vision Alignment (10 min)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Goal:** clarify *purpose* and *emotional architecture*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "what do we want people to *feel* when they land here?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "what is this site ultimately *for* — visibility? preservation? resistance? all?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "how personal should the site be? (biographical vs. professional vs. poetic)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2. Audience & Accessibility (10 min)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Goal:** define who we’re speaking to and how they’ll engage"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-21",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "primary audience: academics? students? press? general public?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-22",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "tone of language: first-person? third? essayistic or editorial?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-23",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "bilingual needs? accessibility expectations?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**3. Content Mapping Review (10 min)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Goal:** confirm the structure + what lives in each space"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-28",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "walk through proposed site outline"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-29",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "discuss any additions, removals, or consolidations"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-30",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "discuss static vs. dynamic content (what needs to evolve over time?)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**4. Design Concepts Overview (15 min)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Goal:** present visual/tonal concepts and invite feedback"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-35",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "present **Blind / Thread / Study**"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-36",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "present **Drift / Trace / Still**"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "clarify these as *registers* not binaries — all muted, minimal, intentional"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-38",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "discuss preferences: typography, pace of animation, color restraint, use of space"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-39",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "check alignment with her own self-perception + comfort"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**5. Visual & Sonic Moodboarding (10 min)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Goal:** dial in abstract vibe through real elements"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-44",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "share musical references: roberta flack, shabaka, sinephro, etc."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-45",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "discuss potential for sound design or audio presence"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-46",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "share film/event visuals (like the Black France poster) — what resonates, what doesn’t"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**6. Key Unknowns / Permissions (10 min)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Goal:** surface anything that still needs clarification"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-51",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "personal imagery: portrait or abstract?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-52",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "what archival material can be shared?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-53",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "which quotes, media, or moments feel essential to include?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-54",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "is the site meant to be expanded over time?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**7. Next Steps & Follow-up (5 min)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-58",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "confirm any needed follow-ups or assets from her"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-59",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "define timeline for first build-out or prototype"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-60",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "confirm communication cadence"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "optional: **Close with a Question**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "“if this site could hold one truth about your work, not said directly but *felt*... what would it be?”"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}